#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9702 expect=skipped domain=TS
# Rule:Description: FDA-SD9702 — the Required key TSPARM is not populated.
#note "TSPARM is absent from TS, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(TSPARM) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col TSSEQ type=Char
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL type=Char
---
S1      | TS     | 1     | TITLE    | A Study
---
